<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Hydra vulgaris activator-inhibitor morphogenesis — Code-to-model traceability: 64/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Docstring cites Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Eqs. (15a)-(15b), but lacks explicit mappings to Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Fig. 2-3 (regeneration), Meinhardt (1993) (tentacle ring), and the 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py L1–L18: Baseline module header without Lean 4 theorem or regeneration figure mappings <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/3cb5ea9/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L1-L18>" ;
    pk:hasScore 6.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Hydra vulgaris activator-inhibitor morphogenesis — Model fidelity to source: 62/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Eqs. (15a)-(15b) 1D PDE with zero-flux Neumann boundary conditions (L85-134) and exact linear stability analysis (L38-82, d_c = 5.8284, a_* = 1.5, h_* = 2.25). However, v1 omits Gierer & Meinhardt's signature surgical bisection and head regeneration experiment (Fig. 3), omits periodic circular ring morphogenesis for the tentacle whorl (Meinhardt 1993), and runs no equal-diffusion negative control (D_a = D_h)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py L85–L134: 1D polar column solver without bisection regeneration or equal-diffusion negative control <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/3cb5ea9/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L85-L134>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 6.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Hydra vulgaris activator-inhibitor morphogenesis — Morphometric validation: 45/100" ;
