    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py L190–L215: Only 3 scalar measurements without CV/RMSE/r or specimen tentacle morphometrics <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/3cb5ea9/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L190-L215>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-measurement-apical-hypostome-peak-cell-index-along-polar-hydra-column-n-60>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-measurement-gierer-meinhardt-critical-diffusivity-ratio-d-c-sqrt-2-1-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-measurement-homogeneous-steady-state-activator-concentration-a-rho-0-0> ;
    pk:hasScore 4.5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Hydra vulgaris activator-inhibitor morphogenesis — MorphoEval overall 52.8/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py` (55.0/100). The v1 baseline implements the 1D Gierer-Meinhardt (1972) Eqs. (15a)-(15b) activator-inhibitor PDE on a 60-cell apico-basal column and computes the analytical dispersion relation sigma(k) and critical diffusivity ratio d_c = (sqrt(2)+1)^2 = 5.8284, but omits surgical bisection head regeneration (Gierer & Meinhardt 1972 Fig. 3), periodic sub-hypostomal tentacle-ring morphogenesis (Meinhardt 1993), equal-diffusion negative control (D_a = D_h), allometric domain-scaling peak insertion, and automated computer-vision segmentation of the vendored Hydra vulgaris specimen image. Overall 52.8/100 (faithfulness 47.2, reproducibility 65.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 3cb5ea9; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 62, Morphological realism / specimen match 38, Parameter expressivity 44, Morphometric validation 45, Source and data traceability 68, Code-to-model traceability 64, Reproducibility package 65. Output judged: docs/media/hydra_activator_inhibitor_comparison.png: rendered output of 1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py at 3cb5ea9, image/png, 484460 B, 1820×585 px, artifact_sha256 72f7922212aac99cead5e633ce2a3c1e248bc5e079c62022fb0fd08286be4dbe (sha256 72f7922212aac99cead5e633ce2a3c1e248bc5e079c62022fb0fd08286be4dbe), spec_fingerprint c9d51c7c93ac67b33d6bf4ce3308cc6670cda412367b820e85de0adf71aa9719. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: c9d51c7c93ac67b33d6bf4ce3308cc6670cda412367b820e85de0adf71aa9719; artifact_sha256: 72f7922212aac99cead5e633ce2a3c1e248bc5e079c62022fb0fd08286be4dbe; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/hydra_activator_inhibitor/hydra_activator_inhibitor_reference.json=f9d8a0be5130d952..., datasets/hydra_activator_inhibitor/hydra_vulgaris_specimen.jpg=007d127bcfa8501d..., datasets/hydra_activator_inhibitor/paper_citations.bib=49b5c0a5531a00fe..., datasets/hydra_activator_inhibitor/scout_manifest.json=b57d0d923283daaf...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add runtime SHA-256 verification of all files in `datasets/hydra_activator_inhibitor/`, expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 8 quantitative measurements with reference values, CV/RMSE/r uncertainty, and negative-control delta, expose full CLI flags, and upgrade the comparison figure to a 9-panel publication synthesis.",
        "remediation needed: Implement Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Fig. 3 surgical bisection and head regeneration experiment (cutting the 60-cell column at x = 30 after apical peak formation and verifying autonomous regeneration of a new apical hypostome peak in the basal fragment once long-range inhibitor decays).",
        "remediation needed: Implement Meinhardt (1993) periodic circular tentacle-ring reaction-diffusion simulation (C = 50 cells, periodic BCs) producing 6 evenly spaced tentacle primordia, paired with an equal-diffusion negative control (D_a = D_h = 0.015, d = 1.0 < d_c = 5.8284) and a 6-point diffusivity-ratio sweep across d in {1.0, 3.0, 5.0, 8.0, 15.0, 30.0}.",
        "remediation needed: Implement automated computer-vision segmentation of `datasets/hydra_activator_inhibitor/hydra_vulgaris_specimen.jpg` to extract the Hydra polyp silhouette, apico-basal body axis, apical hypostome centroid, and angular positions/spacing CV of the 6 radiating tentacles, plus an allometric domain-length scaling sweep L in {20, 35, 50, 65, 80, 95} with Pearson r and RMSE." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.28e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Hydra vulgaris activator-inhibitor morphogenesis — Parameter expressivity: 44/100" ;
